{
  "info": {
    "name": "Gooswing API — Staging",
    "description": "Collection de test pour les 7 routes /v1/events* du module goswing (staging).\n\nAuth Clerk JWT auto-minté à chaque requête via pre-request script.\nNécessite l'environnement 'Gooswing staging' importé en parallèle.\n\nDocs spec : C:\\Users\\X1\\Documents\\GoSwing\\odoo-api-spec\\routes\\events.json\nRapport tests : clients/goosw/cr/rapport-test-api-events-2026-05-18.html",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{jwt}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Auto-mint d'un JWT Clerk frais avant chaque requête.",
          "// Postman ne wait pas les callbacks pm.sendRequest nested → on utilise",
          "// async/await + IIFE pour FORCER Postman à attendre la fin du flow",
          "// avant d'envoyer la requête principale.",
          "//",
          "// Env vars requis :",
          "//   clerk_secret        — sk_test_... (Dashboard Clerk → API Keys)",
          "//   clerk_test_user_id  — Clerk user ID cible",
          "//",
          "// Si quelque chose plante : View → Show Postman Console (Ctrl+Alt+C)",
          "",
          "const secret = pm.environment.get('clerk_secret');",
          "const userId = pm.environment.get('clerk_test_user_id');",
          "",
          "if (!secret || secret.includes('REPLACE_')) {",
          "    throw new Error('clerk_secret env var manque ou contient encore le placeholder REPLACE_. Renseigner sk_test_... depuis le Dashboard Clerk → API Keys → Secret keys.');",
          "}",
          "if (!userId) {",
          "    throw new Error('clerk_test_user_id env var manque. Dashboard Clerk → Users → copie l\\'ID du user de test.');",
          "}",
          "",
          "const send = (opts) => new Promise((resolve, reject) => {",
          "    pm.sendRequest(opts, (err, res) => {",
          "        if (err) return reject(err);",
          "        if (res.code !== 200) {",
          "            return reject(new Error('HTTP ' + res.code + ': ' + (res.text() || '').substring(0, 200)));",
          "        }",
          "        resolve(res);",
          "    });",
          "});",
          "",
          "const headers = {",
          "    'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + secret,",
          "    'Content-Type': 'application/json',",
          "    'User-Agent': 'Postman-OPTIDEEP/1.0'",
          "};",
          "",
          "// Pattern : await chain dans IIFE async — Postman attend la résolution finale",
          "await (async () => {",
          "    const sessionRes = await send({",
          "        url: 'https://api.clerk.com/v1/sessions',",
          "        method: 'POST',",
          "        header: headers,",
          "        body: { mode: 'raw', raw: JSON.stringify({ user_id: userId }) }",
          "    });",
          "    const sessionId = sessionRes.json().id;",
          "",
          "    const tokenRes = await send({",
          "        url: 'https://api.clerk.com/v1/sessions/' + sessionId + '/tokens',",
          "        method: 'POST',",
          "        header: headers",
          "    });",
          "",
          "    pm.environment.set('jwt', tokenRes.json().jwt);",
          "    console.log('[Gooswing] Fresh JWT minté pour ' + userId + ' (session ' + sessionId + ')');",
          "})();"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "https://web.gooswing.com",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. (Manual) Refresh JWT now",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{clerk_secret}}"},
          {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
          {"key": "User-Agent", "value": "Postman-OPTIDEEP/1.0"}
        ],
        "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"user_id\": \"{{clerk_test_user_id}}\"}"},
        "url": {
          "raw": "https://api.clerk.com/v1/sessions",
          "host": ["api", "clerk", "com"],
          "path": ["v1", "sessions"]
        },
        "description": "Fallback manuel si le pre-request script auto-mint plante. Clic Send → tu vois la response avec le session id. La Tests-script enchaîne automatiquement avec /v1/sessions/<id>/tokens et stocke le JWT dans la variable d'env. Après ça, les requêtes #1-7 marchent."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// Cette requête principale crée la session. Le Tests script fait",
              "// le 2e call (mint token) et stocke le JWT.",
              "if (pm.response.code !== 200) {",
              "    console.error('[Gooswing] /v1/sessions failed:', pm.response.text());",
              "    return;",
              "}",
              "const sessionId = pm.response.json().id;",
              "console.log('[Gooswing] Session créée :', sessionId);",
              "",
              "pm.sendRequest({",
              "    url: 'https://api.clerk.com/v1/sessions/' + sessionId + '/tokens',",
              "    method: 'POST',",
              "    header: {",
              "        'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + pm.environment.get('clerk_secret'),",
              "        'Content-Type': 'application/json',",
              "        'User-Agent': 'Postman-OPTIDEEP/1.0'",
              "    }",
              "}, (err, res) => {",
              "    if (err || res.code !== 200) {",
              "        console.error('[Gooswing] /tokens failed:', err || res.text());",
              "        return;",
              "    }",
              "    const jwt = res.json().jwt;",
              "    pm.environment.set('jwt', jwt);",
              "    console.log('[Gooswing] JWT stocké dans env.jwt (' + jwt.substring(0, 30) + '...)');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. List published events",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{"key": "Accept", "value": "application/json"}],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/events",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["v1", "events"]
        },
        "description": "Spec : GET /v1/events — Liste tous les events publiés, triés par date_begin ascendant. Pas de query params."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Event detail (by UUID or slug)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{"key": "Accept", "value": "application/json"}],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/events/:id",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["v1", "events", ":id"],
          "variable": [
            {
              "key": "id",
              "value": "cafe-hafa-sunset-live",
              "description": "UUID (gw_external_id) ou slug (gw_slug). Exemples seedés : tanjazz-festival, cap-spartel-beach-dj-sunset, asilah-acoustic-night, tetouan-andalusian-night, cafe-hafa-sunset-live, tangerine-late-night-house, movenpick-rooftop-lounge"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Spec : GET /v1/events/:id — résolution UUID puis fallback slug."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Ticket types for event",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{"key": "Accept", "value": "application/json"}],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/events/:id/ticket-types",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["v1", "events", ":id", "ticket-types"],
          "variable": [
            {
              "key": "id",
              "value": "tanjazz-festival",
              "description": "UUID ou slug de l'event"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Spec : GET /v1/events/:id/ticket-types — tickets dans la fenêtre de vente courante (sales_start_at <= now <= sales_end_at)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Events by organizer",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{"key": "Accept", "value": "application/json"}],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/organizers/:organizerId/events?limit=5",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["v1", "organizers", ":organizerId", "events"],
          "query": [
            {"key": "limit", "value": "5", "description": "Default 5, min 1, max 50"},
            {"key": "exclude", "value": "", "description": "UUID d'event à exclure (ex. l'event courant qu'on est en train de regarder)", "disabled": true}
          ],
          "variable": [
            {
              "key": "organizerId",
              "value": "REPLACE_WITH_UUID_FROM_/v1/events_response",
              "description": "UUID de l'organisateur (champ organizerId du payload Event). Récupère-le en lançant d'abord la requête #1."
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Spec : GET /v1/organizers/:organizerId/events — mini-cards des events de l'organisateur."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Similar events",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{"key": "Accept", "value": "application/json"}],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/events/:id/similar?limit=5",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["v1", "events", ":id", "similar"],
          "query": [
            {"key": "limit", "value": "5", "description": "Default 5, min 1, max 50"}
          ],
          "variable": [
            {
              "key": "id",
              "value": "cap-spartel-beach-dj-sunset",
              "description": "Events similaires : même gw_category sinon fallback tags."
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Spec : GET /v1/events/:id/similar — category-first, fallback tags."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Upcoming by venue and/or organizer",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{"key": "Accept", "value": "application/json"}],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/events/upcoming-by-venue-or-organizer?organizerId=&venueId=&limit=20",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["v1", "events", "upcoming-by-venue-or-organizer"],
          "query": [
            {"key": "organizerId", "value": "", "description": "UUID organisateur (optionnel SI venueId est passé)"},
            {"key": "venueId", "value": "", "description": "UUID venue (optionnel SI organizerId est passé)"},
            {"key": "exclude", "value": "", "description": "UUID d'event à exclure", "disabled": true},
            {"key": "limit", "value": "20", "description": "Default 20, min 1, max 100"}
          ]
        },
        "description": "Spec : GET /v1/events/upcoming-by-venue-or-organizer — union deduped venue + organizer.\n\n⚠️ Au moins UN des deux (organizerId / venueId) est requis, sinon 400 validation_failed."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Event attendees",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{"key": "Accept", "value": "application/json"}],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/events/:id/attendees?limit=20",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["v1", "events", ":id", "attendees"],
          "query": [
            {"key": "limit", "value": "20", "description": "Default 20, min 1, max 100"}
          ],
          "variable": [
            {
              "key": "id",
              "value": "tanjazz-festival",
              "description": "UUID event (pas de fallback slug ici)"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Spec : GET /v1/events/:id/attendees — { attendees, totalCount }. Distinct users (par clerk_user_id) avec réservations confirmed/completed."
      }
    }
  ]
}
